== Section 16 __NOEDITSECTION__==
<div class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-myDivision">
<div class="mw-collapsible-content"> 
<blockquote>There was young scab of Darat,</blockquote><blockquote>Whose paws were as quick as a cat.</blockquote><blockquote>He'd pilfer and pluck,</blockquote><blockquote>From any old duck,</blockquote><blockquote>And keep it all under his hat.</blockquote>
</div>
</div>

